{"timestamp": 1772140988070.9893, "start_timestamp": 1772140988067, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/status/commerce/user/info", "data": {"userId": 1615, "cardId": ""}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0a1pC5000dfMVV1RGT000Tnonz0pC50u", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 253b1b7a3c92483b843f2f5291e59055"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1772140988224, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"userId": "1615", "cardId": "1960560586298163202", "address": "上海市青浦区虹桥世界中心E幢3楼301室", "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "ipArea": "上海市", "mobile": "17681122999", "name": "邵昆仑测试环境", "nativePlace": {"provinceCode": "31", "province": "上海市", "cityCode": "3101", "city": "市辖区", "areaCode": "310120", "area": "奉贤区"}, "personalIntroduction": "我是一个热爱生活的人🌿，电影与旅行让我学会用心感受当下的美好。在电影世界里，我领悟到交流中传递情感与思想的力量，让每一次对话都成为心灵共鸣的桥梁✨。旅行时，我沉醉于探索不同风景，用脚步丈量世界的同时，也收获了对生活细节的深刻感悟🌍。\n\n我习惯以欣赏的心态拥抱平凡日常，清晨的阳光、午后的微风，都能让普通的日子变得温暖舒适☀️。假期里，我享受悠闲放松的时刻，简单的快乐最能治愈人心，和朋友相聚时，哪怕只是安静坐着，也能感受默契带来的甜蜜🥰。\n\n我相信，用心感受生活点滴美好，无论是与朋友畅快聊天，还是独自享受旅行自由，都是对时光最好的回馈。那些治愈疲惫的瞬间、值得珍藏的小确幸，让我懂得：生活的美", "tag1": "建设理想国", "tag2": "自由追梦人", "wechat": "17681122808", "backUpUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/template/B-B8.png", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/stag/20251205/8c5377eea4f77e6b92207929d13a552f08e2d58145d7a6e04b4182f84ece5b39.jpg", "portraitUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/prod/portrait/20251130/3f67ba0bf35af9dec38ede306e0ecc3b933db966a7c6bb9404cd8bcfca8b9653.png", "nativePlaceName": ["上海市", "市辖区", "奉贤区"], "exchangeStatus": -1, "isMine": 1, "memberStatus": true, "templateId": "9", "styleId": "80", "shareId": "76", "cardIdentityType": null, "currentIdentityId": "", "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260226/b1af65b00b2e0eeec85692f5f8d8d19b927adef38c3e2cdad10b